WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.052 --> 00:00:06.145
Pia sits on her mother's feet.

2
00:00:06.146 --> 00:00:09.496
"When can I learn to walk, Mom?"

3
00:00:09.497 --> 00:00:14.112
But Mom isn't listening—she's watching a large seabird.

4
00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:16.564
"Stay still, Pia."

5
00:00:16.565 --> 00:00:19.595
"Why?" Pia asks.

6
00:00:19.596 --> 00:00:27.749
"That's a skua," Mom says. "Beware—they eat young chicks."

7
00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:33.876
The bird swoops over the colony and flies away.

8
00:00:33.877 --> 00:00:37.798
"Why did it leave?" Pia asks.

9
00:00:37.799 --> 00:00:42.041
"Predators watch for movement," Mom says.

10
00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:48.246
"Oh," Pia says. "Um, can I try walking now?"

11
00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:51.258
"Sure," Mom says.

12
00:00:51.259 --> 00:00:56.139
Pia hops off Mom's feet and takes a step.

13
00:00:56.140 --> 00:01:01.245
Pia wobbles but stays on her feet.

14
00:01:01.246 --> 00:01:07.150
A smaller chick watches her. "I'm Em.

15
00:01:07.151 --> 00:01:11.344
Wow! You're so good at walking!"

16
00:01:11.345 --> 00:01:15.553
"I can teach you," Pia says.

17
00:01:15.554 --> 00:01:19.516
Em takes one step . . . and falls over.

18
00:01:19.517 --> 00:01:26.832
"Try again," Pia says. "Like this."

19
00:01:26.833 --> 00:01:31.716
Soon Pia and Em are walking together.

20
00:01:31.717 --> 00:01:35.276
"Let's race!" Pia says.

21
00:01:35.277 --> 00:01:38.590
The two chicks waddle fast.

22
00:01:38.591 --> 00:01:44.768
Em falls down and giggles. "You win."

23
00:01:44.769 --> 00:01:50.051
"Look out!" A large chick is sliding toward them!

24
00:01:50.053 --> 00:01:55.566
He crashes into Pia and Em and grins.

25
00:01:55.567 --> 00:01:59.161
"Whoa! That was amazing!"

26
00:01:59.162 --> 00:02:04.213
Pia scowls. "You almost hurt us!

27
00:02:04.214 --> 00:02:06.541
Are you okay, Em?"

28
00:02:06.542 --> 00:02:11.679
"Sorry!" the big chick says. "I'm Flip.

29
00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:16.163
I like sliding fast but didn't mean to hurt anyone."

30
00:02:16.164 --> 00:02:19.028
"I'm okay," Em says.

31
00:02:19.029 --> 00:02:22.999
"Why are you sliding?" Pia asks.

32
00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:27.008
Flip grins. "It's fun.

33
00:02:27.009 --> 00:02:30.417
Sliding is much faster than walking."

34
00:02:30.418 --> 00:02:37.457
"Let's try it," Pia says.

35
00:02:37.458 --> 00:02:41.800
The three chicks lie on their bellies.

36
00:02:41.801 --> 00:02:52.166
They push off with their feet. "Whee!"

37
00:02:52.167 --> 00:02:58.326
Suddenly Pia hears an alarm call. "Skua!"

38
00:02:58.327 --> 00:03:03.787
Em gulps. "Skuas eat chicks!"

39
00:03:03.788 --> 00:03:08.756
Flip squawks. "What if it grabs us?"

40
00:03:08.757 --> 00:03:11.291
Pia's heart pounds.

41
00:03:11.292 --> 00:03:14.915
She thinks of what Mom said.

42
00:03:14.917 --> 00:03:19.457
"Drop down and stay still," Pia says.

43
00:03:19.458 --> 00:03:27.750
The three chicks lie very, very still.

44
00:03:27.751 --> 00:03:32.916
The skua swoops low—and then leaves!

45
00:03:32.917 --> 00:03:36.865
"You saved us, Pia," Flip says.

46
00:03:36.866 --> 00:03:40.193
Em nods. "Thanks."

47
00:03:40.194 --> 00:03:48.929
"You're welcome." Pia grins. "Now let's slide some more!"

